<title>USA: Interpool sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Interpool sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interpool Inc said Wednesday its board had approved a three-for-two stock split effective March 27, record March 21.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be rounded up to the nearest whole share, it said.</p>
